Arlei Bichels. Sistemas elétricos de potência: métodos de análise e solução, EDUTFPR, Curitiba, 2018. [Institutional book and complete files](https://repositorio.utfpr.edu.br/jspui/handle/1/4610) · [Institutional front matter](https://riut.utfpr.edu.br/jspui/bitstream/1/4610/6/sistemaseletricopotencia_iniciais.pdf).

Read the whole Portuguese text with its models, mathematical methods, examples and realistic equipment data. Reconstruct calculations independently of the commercial programs used for some examples; compare with freely available tools only after matching equations and assumptions.

The catalogue lists 466 pages and an inconsistent shortened ISBN; indexed front matter gives 497 pages, ISBN 978-85-7014-208-5 and a 2017 copyright beside the 2018 bibliographic year. Preserve these distinctions rather than silently guessing one pagination. Its notice permits attributed unchanged noncommercial sharing, consistent with CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, not unrestricted adaptation. The 112.71 MB main file exceeded ordinary inspection capacity and direct front-matter retrieval was intermittent on 29 October 2026. Catalogue/indexed notices were checked; complete-page verification is not claimed. No file is copied here.

